## Worksheet

**F1**: G object, makeRng(seed) used throughout; resolveTurnCore() calls hazard→production→needs→fatigue→moraleZero in fixed order, called from onEndTurn(). Score 2.

**F2**: genMap() builds 8x8 via G.rng; canBuildAt() checks def.terrain.includes(tile.terrain); adjacency bonus added to base before ratio mult in resolveProduction(). Score 2.

**F3**: ore→metal (mine→forge consumes ore+power) and water/ash→soil→food (composter→greenhouse); storageCap()/addRes() cap and log overflow. Score 2.

**F4**: colonist records {skill,fatigue,morale,job,assigned}; skillFactor()/fatigueFactor()/moraleFactor() read in resolveProduction(). Score 2.

**F5**: resolveNeeds() consumes food/water, writes morale delta on shortage, moraleFactor() feeds production ratio; morale recovers (+2/turn) when needs met. Score 2.

**F6**: 9 RESEARCH nodes; canResearch() enforces prereq array; purchaseResearch() deducts scrip/parts; effects (condenserMult, generatorMult, stormMitigation, repairDiscount, building unlocks) all read elsewhere. Score 2.

**F7**: 12 EVENTS; pickWeighted() by e.weight; eventState[id] cooldown tracked; 5 events (wandererArrives, contaminatedWater, colonistDispute, ashLungSickness, raiderSkirmish) have 2 differing-outcome choices. Score 2.

**F8**: buyPrice() reads G.res[res]/cap ratio and market.drift[res] (random-walked each turn in updateMarketForNewTurn); inventory qty capped/decremented; tradeBuy/tradeSell both functional. Score 2.

**F9**: resolveHazard() fires every 8 turns, severity=8+floor(turn/8)*3; damageFactor(b.damage) cuts production ratio; windbreak/stormShelters/reinforced reduce mitigation; repairBuilding() spends parts, resets damage. Score 2.

**F10**: serializeState() → JSON in textarea; loadBtn parses JSON, validateSaveObj() checks fields, loadMsg shows clear error text. Score 2.

**F11**: checkEndConditions() has reachable win (turn≥60,pop≥12,no shortage) and lose (pop=0); computeScore() uses pop/research/stock/turn; showEndScreen() renders overlay summary. Score 2.

**F12**: switchTab() wired to nav buttons and keys '1'-'5'; Space→onEndTurn(); pushLog stores {turn,msg} rendered as "T{turn}"; attachTooltip()/resTooltipHtml() explain per-building contributions; @media(max-width:480px) reflows layout. Score 2.

**F13**: runTests() asserts real invariants (cap enforcement, PRNG determinism, prereq gating, save/load hash equality, bounded stats); runBenchmark() runs 200 headless turns via endTurnAuto(), prints stateHash(). Score 2.

**G1**: efficientCondensers/geothermal store *Mult in RESEARCH; resolveProduction() reads G.research.done.* to build yieldMult applied to produced amt every turn, visible via resBar/tooltip. Score 4.

**G2**: resolveNeeds() shortage writes colonist morale delta; moraleFactor(worker.morale) multiplies production ratio in resolveProduction() next cycle; visible via morale bar/efficiency tooltip. Score 4.

**G3**: resolveHazard() sets b.damage; damageFactor(b.damage) cuts ratio in resolveProduction(); repairBuilding() spends parts and resets damage=0, restoring output. Score 4.

**G4**: buyPrice() reads G.res[res]/storageCap ratio and G.market.drift[res], drift updated every turn in updateMarketForNewTurn(). Score 4.

**G5**: wandererArrives choices push colonist+consume food/water vs +scrip/morale hit; contaminatedWater choices spend parts vs lose water+morale — both write distinct state fields, not just log. Score 4.

